cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use signatomics, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "signatomics: Python tools for Olink (PEA) proteomics data"
abstract: >-
  Python tools for Olink (PEA) proteomics data: read NPX files, quality control,
  plate bridging, sample metadata, statistics (group comparisons, correlations,
  adjusted models) and biomarker signatures with nested cross-validation,
  with every step reported.
